# GUI redesign mockups - local design reference only, not project artifacts.
docs/mockups/

# Packaged installer build output and staged third-party runtimes -
# rebuilt locally by build_installer.ps1, never committed (the Tesseract
# copy alone runs ~100MB).
build/
dist/
installer_output/
packaging/tesseract/
*.spec.bak

# Local mirror of the private cross-project _wiedza-ai skill library
# (installed via install-projekt.ps1). This repo is public - a private
# methodology mirror belongs on disk only, never committed here. Claude
# Code reads these files directly off disk regardless of git tracking,
# so untracking them changes nothing functionally.
.ai/
AGENTS.md

# User's own root-level scratch files - personal notes, ideas, ad-hoc
# scripts. This repo is public; a careless `git add -A` under the now
# largely autonomous workflow must not be able to sweep these in.
# notatki.txt in particular has held unredacted business context in the
# past (see docs/PROJECT_STATE.md's 2026-09-15 redaction commit) - this
# is the preventive fix for that exact class of leak, not a one-off.
/notatki.txt
/pomysly/
/diagnostyka_skanu.py
/sprawdz_tesseract.ps1
